      "Guides DNA, RNA, and protein sequence manipulation, translation, motif searches, and quality metadata handling.",
      "Explains pairwise alignments, multiple sequence alignments, consensus workflows, and alignment format conversion.",
      "Covers TreeNode, neighbor joining, UPGMA, patristic distances, and Robinson-Foulds tree comparisons.",
      "Describes alpha diversity, beta diversity, UniFrac, PCoA, PERMANOVA, ANOSIM, and Mantel tests.",
      "Summarizes table, distance matrix, ordination, and protein embedding workflows."
